WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.851 --> 00:00:12.411
Login karte hi Medoro ka dashboard khulta hai.

2
00:00:12.451 --> 00:00:18.123
Yahan ek hi screen par aaj ki bikri, munafa,
khareed, kharch aur bakaaya,

3
00:00:18.163 --> 00:00:19.688
sab kuch dikhta hai.

4
00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:24.383
Upar Today, saat din aur tees din ke beech badal
sakte hain.

5
00:00:25.153 --> 00:00:29.443
Sales today mein aaj ki kul bikri aur bills ki
ginti hai.

6
00:00:29.483 --> 00:00:35.445
Gross margin batata hai ki GST se pehle, returns
ghataakar, kitna munafa bacha.

7
00:00:36.217 --> 00:00:40.614
Purchases mein supplier bills, aur Expenses mein
aaj ke kharch.

8
00:00:40.654 --> 00:00:43.854
Receivables yaani customers se kitna lena hai,

9
00:00:43.894 --> 00:00:47.164
aur Payables yaani suppliers ko kitna dena hai.

10
00:00:47.941 --> 00:00:50.451
Ab tees din wala view dekhte hain.

11
00:00:50.491 --> 00:00:56.301
Sales chart har din ki bikri GST sahit dikhata
hai, aur neeche cash, UPI, card

12
00:00:56.341 --> 00:00:59.376
aur credit mein collection ka hisaab hai.

13
00:01:00.129 --> 00:01:03.072
Insights box zaroori baatein khud batata hai,

14
00:01:03.112 --> 00:01:06.055
jaise kitna stock jaldi expire hone wala hai,

15
00:01:06.095 --> 00:01:09.303
ya kaunsi medicines reorder level se neeche
hain.

16
00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.964
Neeche Low stock ki list hai,

17
00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:17.432
aur 'Expiring within 90 days' mein woh batches
jo nabbe din ke andar expire honge,

18
00:01:17.473 --> 00:01:19.900
unki keemat aur bache dinon ke saath.

19
00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:24.125
Branch performance mein har branch ki bikri
dikhti hai,

20
00:01:24.165 --> 00:01:27.778
aur saath mein Google Drive ki aakhri full copy
ka samay,

21
00:01:27.818 --> 00:01:30.598
taaki aapko pata rahe ki data surakshit hai.

22
00:01:31.361 --> 00:01:36.017
Sabse neeche Recent activity mein har bill aur
badlaav ka record hai.

23
00:01:36.057 --> 00:01:40.781
Upar Export button se dashboard ki report
download bhi kar sakte hain.
